commit 4aaf7cd856d9bfb688193ae8542bddcb64c0d4b8
Author: Aleksandr Beshkenadze <beshkenadze@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Mar 25 21:41:37 2026 +0200

    feat: add Kokoro TTS with multilingual support (#124)
    
    * feat: add MLXAudioNeuralG2P multilingual ByT5 G2P
    
    Self-contained multilingual grapheme-to-phoneme module using ByT5
    encoder-decoder architecture. Supports 100+ languages via
    beshkenadze/g2p-multilingual-byT5-tiny-mlx model.
    
    - 14 source files (T5 encoder-decoder, byte-level tokenizer, weight loader)
    - G2PTypes.swift: Phonemizing protocol, PhonemeUnit, G2PError
    - NeuralPhonemizer: word-level G2P conforming to Phonemizing protocol
    - CI: skip SmokeTests, disable parallel testing for Metal VM stability
    
    * feat: add StyleTTS2 shared blocks, ALBERT encoder, and English G2P
    
    StyleTTS2 architecture foundation shared by KittenTTS and Kokoro:
    
    - Blocks/: 8 shared NN modules (BiLSTM, WeightNormedConv, AdaIN, SourceModule, etc.)
    - Albert.swift: ALBERT encoder (6 Module-based classes)
    - SharedConfigs.swift: PLBertConfig + ISTFTNetConfig
    - G2P/: English phonemization (Misaki port) with BART fallback network
    - TextProcessor.swift: protocol for text→phoneme conversion
    - MisakiTextProcessor: async prepare() downloads from HuggingFace
    
    * fix: remove misleading logitBias comment and unused temperature param in BARTModel
    
    * chore: remove .sisyphus plans from repo
    
    * refactor: move G2P into StyleTTS2 directory per review
    
    * feat: add KittenTTS text-to-speech model
    
    Adds the KittenTTS model (StyleTTS2-based) with:
    - KittenTTSConfig, KittenTTSModel, KittenTTSModules, KittenTTSISTFTNet, KittenTTSTextCleaner
    - TTSModel factory with kitten_tts case
    - Unit tests for config, sanitization, and factory inference
    - Uses shared types from StyleTTS2/ (Albert, PLBertConfig, ISTFTNetConfig)
    - Uses G2P/ MisakiTextProcessor for English phonemization
    
    * fix: address Copilot review — discard unused params, remove dead Metal import, test actual inference
    
    * feat: add Kokoro TTS with multilingual support
    
    * fix: address Copilot review — add voiceCache lock, fix error messages, restore Metal guard for tests
    
    * docs: align Kokoro README with official model card
    
    * test: prepare Kokoro network fixtures explicitly

